[E0401] Error: use of moved value `a`
    ╭─[ err/79_named_argument_moves/main.wip:14:32 ]
    │
 14 │     keep(token: move a, look: &a)
    │                 ───┬──         ┬  
    │                    ╰────────────── `a` moved here
    │                                │  
    │                                ╰── used here after the move
    │ 
    │ Note: after `move`, `a` holds no value until it is assigned again
