[E0414] Error: cannot move `b` while an earlier argument borrows it
    ╭─[ err/79_named_argument_moves/main.wip:16:27 ]
    │
 16 │     keep(look: &b, token: move b)
    │                ─┬         ───┬──  
    │                 ╰───────────────── borrowed here, until the call returns
    │                              │    
    │                              ╰──── moved here
    │ 
    │ Note: arguments are evaluated left to right, and a reference argument must still be valid when the call starts
────╯
